research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f2-cantor-hessenberg.log-5299-    87	3.1 Combining: $\kappa \le \kappa \oplus \lambda \le \kappa \oplus \kappa \le \kappa$ gives $\kappa \oplus \lambda = \kappa$ by [L6]; and for $\lambda \ne 0$, $\kappa \le \kappa \otimes \lambda \le \kappa \otimes \kappa = \kappa$ gives $\kappa \otimes \lambda = \kappa$, while $\kappa \otimes 0 = 0$ by [L3]. [step 1.1, step 1.3, step 1.4, step 2.1, L1, L3, L6] ∎
