research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f2-cantor-hessenberg.log-5574-    71	[L7] A subset inclusion is an injection and a bijection witnesses $\approx$ ([[def-injection-surjection-bijection]], [[def-equinumerous]]).
