research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f1-cardinal-core.log-6942-    81	**Hessenberg's theorem is the engine.** $\kappa \otimes \kappa = \kappa$ for
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f1-cardinal-core.log-6943-    82	every infinite cardinal, proved from a single well-order of $\kappa \times \kappa$
