research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f1-cardinal-core.log-6960-    99	**Where choice is measured exactly.** Comparability of arbitrary sets is
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f1-cardinal-core.log-6961-   100	equivalent to the Axiom of Choice ([[thm-cardinal-comparability-iff-ac]]), so the
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f1-cardinal-core.log-6962-   101	trichotomy this page uses freely for cardinals is *not* available for sets. And
