research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f3-hierarchies-ac.log-6146-items/ex-powers-of-omega-and-epsilon-zero.md:75:[L4] $\bigcup A$ is an ordinal and the least upper bound of a set $A$ of ordinals; $\mu \subseteq \nu$ iff $\mu \in \nu$ or $\mu = \nu$; $\mu \notin \mu$; and $\mu < \nu$ iff $\mu^{+} \le \nu$ ([[lem-ordinal-basics]], [[lem-ordinal-trichotomy]], [[def-ordinal]]).
